OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks visitors having to walk
OL,4,A'several miles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in rural areas who are
OL,7,Fstruggling to put food on the table are
OL,8,Ffinding it difficult to access the help
OL,9,Fthey need, charities have said.
OL,11,FAt the StoreHouse food bank in Barnard
OL,12,FCastle, County Durham, volunteers said
OL,13,Fsome people walk "several miles" to
OL,14,Fcollect food.
OL,16,FAndrea Wellings, the food bank's
OL,17,Fcommunity co-ordinator, said many "will
OL,18,Fleave bags they can't carry - they'll
OL,19,Ffill a rucksack and that's all they can
OL,20,Fgo away with".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
