OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks visitors having to walk
OL,4,A'several miles'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham County Council said it
OL,7,Frecognised the cost of travel and
OL,8,Flimited access to transport, in some
OL,9,Fcases, can be a "barrier for people on
OL,10,Flow incomes in rural areas" and it is
OL,11,Fworking to develop "practical solutions
OL,12,Fthat improve access to support".
